 This install applies to "Test Drive" © 1987 Accolade.

 Requirements:
 -------------
 WHDLoad version 17.0 or newer must be installed and accessible in the path.
 The game requires 512 KB ChipMem and 128 KB OtherMem, plus memory for WHDLoad
 and any preloaded files. The original Test Drive disk is needed to install.
 Use a complete disk, including its DEVS/system-configuration file.

 The game requires an installed A500 Kickstart 1.3 image.
 The kickstart image must be located in the directory "Devs:Kickstarts" and
 must be named "kick34005.A500". The image can be extracted from a A500 with
 tools like 'GrabKick' or similar which can be found on aminet.
 If the image is of wrong version or altered in any way WHDLoad will quit with
 an appropriate message.
 Additionally the file "kick34005.A500.RTB" must be installed in the same
 directory as the kickstart image. It can be found in the archive
 "util/boot/skick346.lha" on aminet.

 Features:
 ---------
 - Play from hard disk, without disk swapping or copy protection.
 - Joystick and keyboard controls; game instructions are included.
 - Quit to Workbench with numeric keypad '*', configurable with QUITKEY.
 - A choice of three icons, including GlowIcons by Chris Vella.
 - Optional Enhanced framerate for smoother driving, scenery and traffic.

 Enable Enhanced framerate in the WHDLoad options or with CUSTOM2=1. It is
 enabled by default with the Normal icon and the preinstalled game icon.
 The alternative GlowIcons keep their original defaults. Disable the option
 or use CUSTOM2=0 for the original game speed and appearance.

 This is a PAL beta. NTSC and real A1200/68040 testing remain outstanding.

 History:
 --------
 version 2.0b (13.10.2026) done by Vesuri:
 - Optional smoother driving, scenery and traffic with Enhanced framerate.
 - Fixed repeated sideways road jumps when driving near either edge.
 - More consistent game speed, race timing and average-speed scoring.
 - Improved compatibility with accelerated Amigas.
 - Updated installation and documentation.

 version 1.4 (13.04.2023) done by JOTD:
 - Clear error message when a required game file is missing.

 version 1.3 (14.05.2022) done by JOTD:
 - Added keyboard controls.

 version 1.2 (29.01.2021) done by JOTD:
 - Updated WHDLoad support and reduced memory requirements.
 - Source included.

 version 1.1:
 - No longer requires the disk's startup-sequence.

 version 1.0-B:
 - Improved compatibility.

 version 1.0 (2002?) done by JOTD:
 - Initial hard disk install, disk protection removed and quit key added.
 - GlowIcons by Chris Vella and instructions included.

