 Contact:
 --------
 If you have problems, first check for a newer install on the WHDLoad website.
 Try disabling Enhanced framerate. If the problem remains, use the game's
 Bug-Report-Form on that site and include your Amiga and WHDLoad settings.

 For WHDLoad, other installs and updates:
 https://www.whdload.de/
 https://aminet.net/package/dev/misc/WHDLoad
